Last summer, I went to the Qinghai Plateau with my family. It was the most beautiful place I ever saw. The sky was bluer than the sky in the city. The clouds looked soft and close. We walked on the green grassland. The air was thin but fresh. My little sister was happier than ever. We saw a few sheep and horses. I took many photos. It was a trip I will never forget.
