What did people use to believe about dinosaurs?', 'Radio', '{"id": "jc-q-028-028", "title": "Read and answer: For hundreds of years, people believed that dinosaurs looked like huge lizards. But thanks to a piece of amber, scientists now know that dinosaurs had feathers. The amber kept the feathers well. It is like a window on the past. This finding changes our idea of dinosaurs.\nWhat did people use to believe about dinosaurs?", "type": "Radio", "attribute": {"subject": "英语", "difficulty": "easy", "chapter": "Unit 5 Looking into nature", "section": "Unit 5", "knowledgePoint": ["阅读理解"], "examAnalysis": "原文 believed dinosaurs looked like huge lizards。", "examAnswerMode": "onlyOne"}, "children": [{"id": "a", "title": "They had feathers", "attribute": {}}, {"id": "b", "title": "They looked like huge lizards", "attribute": {"examCorrectAnswer": "b"}}, {"id": "c", "title": "They were small", "attribute": {}}, {"id": "d", "title": "They could fly", "attribute": {}}]}', 'exam', '同步练习', '["外研版", "八年级", "下册", "Unit 5 Looking into nature"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, '1457995481966747649', NULL, NULL, '英语', 'Unit 5 Looking into nature', 'Unit 5', '["阅读理解"]', 'easy', '八年级' FROM DUAL WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM t_template WHERE id = 'jc-q-028-028');
